        "The cook (provider) independently represents and warrants that they sell dishes on a lawful basis and hold the proper legal status permitting the systematic receipt of income: they are a payer of the Professional Income Tax (self-employed) under Federal Law No. 422-FZ of 27.11.2018, or are registered as an individual entrepreneur (ИП), or act through a legal entity. The cook undertakes to maintain this status throughout their use of the platform and to stop posting listings immediately upon losing it.",
        "The cook understands that the systematic sale of goods for profit without registration in the established manner constitutes illegal entrepreneurship, entailing administrative liability under Art. 14.1 of the Code of Administrative Offences and, where income is large or especially large, criminal liability under Art. 171 of the Criminal Code. The obligation to register, to choose and apply the proper tax regime, and to pay taxes rests solely with the cook.",
        "When applying the Professional Income Tax regime, the cook independently confirms their eligibility for it, including: the sale of dishes of their own preparation only (not resale), non-exceedance of the statutory income cap (RUB 2.4 million per year), the absence of employees under employment contracts, and the other conditions set by 422-FZ. The cook makes this eligibility assessment themselves and consults a tax adviser if needed; Celina does not perform and is not responsible for such an assessment.",
